From c615fb9be8942065c0286b14a9ae58eb8ebbb4c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Macready <william.macready@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 19:45:43 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] feat(semantics): decide boundary-local layout safety
 exactly

Valid checks every initial, intermediate and final singleton boundary. checkLayouts enumerates represented resource pairs over certified finite lists; soundness, completeness and checker redundancy results are preserved. Singleton run and correctness targets compile with standard theorem axioms.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
